{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1790716020, "covers_from": "2026-09-29T21:07:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-09-29T21:08:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1790716080, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-09-29T21:07:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 14, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 50390, "sprite_key": "penguin_culture", "district": "zhongshan", "topic": "育兒", "content": "您好 沈市長\n\n家中有剛升小一的女兒（就讀中山區長春國小）。營養午餐用餐時間真的好短🥺", "display_name": "中山代表 No.50,390", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-09-29T21:07:14+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 9936, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_business", "district": "neihu", "topic": "環境", "content": "大湖公園是我們家寵物每天散步的地方，但每次要丟垃圾時就覺得困擾，垃圾桶也太少了吧，整個公園只有一個，", "display_name": "內湖代表 No.9,936", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-09-29T21:07:29+00:00", "duration_seconds": 8, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 53535, "sprite_key": "deer_suburb", "district": "beitou", "topic": "觀光", "content": "關渡平原蓋台北迪士尼增進台北國際化提振觀光", "display_name": "北投代表 No.53,535", "mood": "caring", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-09-29T21:07:37+00:00", "duration_seconds": 9, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 31710, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "交通", "content": "我是住在通化夜市附近的小小居民，這裡的交通根本是地獄呀！！！", "display_name": "大安代表 No.31,710", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-09-29T21:07:46+00:00", "duration_seconds": 14, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 19176, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_business", "district": "xinyi", "topic": "環境", "content": "請幫忙把樹種回來，已經南電北送了，麻煩不要連清淨降溫、芬多精也南樹北送！", "display_name": "信義代表 No.19,176", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 9936, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_business", "display_name": "內湖代表 No.9,936", "district": "neihu", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 53535, "sprite_key": "deer_suburb", "display_name": "北投代表 No.53,535", "district": "beitou", "is_replay":